{"4604300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vitalis", "steam_appid": 4604300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604300/extras/c749c3f92f02a34f8e3f83beb2794814.avif?t=1787305191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604300/extras_big/c749c3f92f02a34f8e3f83beb2794814.webp?t=1787305191 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;.:: VITALIS v.0.0.1 ::.&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a forest with seemingly endless rows of trees and the dark that stretches forever. Behind them lies even more danger. Can you make the correct decision to see through to the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take the role of one of the few characters who have found themselves wandering these dangerous lands. Whichever their goal is, one thing remains certain - survive and get away. Learn the story these characters along the way, and perhaps leave this hellscape forever changed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vitalis is a TTRPG-inspired Roguelike, in which the player takes the role of a character whose reason. Movement is determined via die cast, with events determined by landing on tiles. Players can engage in combat, find items, and make choices in random events. A final boss will be guarding the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604300/extras/f694ed6f1f63e0385af442d395c22f87.poster.avif?t=1787305191\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604300/extras/f694ed6f1f63e0385af442d395c22f87.webm?t=1787305191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr